{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaTNMtSrtdFN95rMRuyx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the `sorry` in `sumTo_eq` with a proof, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\n```lean\ntheorem sumTo_eq (n : Nat) : 2 * sumTo n = n * (n + 1) := by\n  induction n with\n  | zero => rfl\n  | succ k ih =>\n    simp only [sumTo, Nat.mul_add, ih, Nat.add_mul, Nat.mul_one, Nat.one_mul]\n    omega\n```\n\nThe proof works by induction on `n`:\n- **`n = 0`:** both sides reduce to `0`, so `rfl` closes it.\n- **Step from `k` to `k + 1`:** it unfolds `sumTo`, multiplies out the products and uses the induction hypothesis to replace `2 * sumTo k` with `k * (k + 1)`. What's left is linear arithmetic, which `omega` closes.\n\nIt only uses Lean's core library, not Mathlib."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":7866,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634},"output_tokens":330,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07046aa1-3a3a-4717-97cc-c2c7c87b1c42","uuid":"07887eb2-064a-44c9-81a6-11ac88d95b20","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:15:19.347Z","request_id":"req_011CgaTNMeoDLgrUxi5VRUKW"}
